      "notes": [
        {
          "no": 1,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "HI Maya,\n\nHope you are well, I am reaching out to you today to let you know we now have our park tickets on sale for 2025 for Disney and Universal, we can add these to your holiday with no deposit and would not need paid until your final balance is due. Please let me know if you would like any prices for theses or if there is anything else I can help you with.\n\nMany Thanks",
          "displayName": "Zoe Tupman",
          "dateModified": "2024-04-01T11:49:57",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~1",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "lpax wnated to do date and destination change\n\nadvised before BDD is best, more flexibility\n\nalso advised \u00A350pp admin fee to change dates\n\npax unsure of dates yet, advised to come back when hes had a little look on our website of flights , hotels etc then we can get it changed over\n\n",
          "displayName": "Sienna A Somerville",
          "dateModified": "2025-08-09T11:37:16",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~2",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 5,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "Lpax called as he wanted to amend the holiday to MBJ instead of Orlando\n\nWanted to go next September to Jamaica, \ncouples sans souci \ntravelling in delight \nFor 12 nights \ninc transfers\n\nadditional \u00A34373.47\n50pp admin fees taken\nPax was happy\n",
          "displayName": "Amber",
          "dateModified": "2025-09-08T18:55:29",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~5",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "Lpax called in wanting to do a date change to MLE in May but the price was higher than expected.\n\nLpax came through as Deryck however the booking is under Maya but this is their middle name. A family member booked their holiday which they are known for as Maya. \n\nI had updated tbox thinking the customer was going ahead with the amendment but they did not so I reverted the name back until pax calls us back in to make the date change amendment.",
          "displayName": "Rhianna Foley",
          "dateModified": "2025-09-04T10:20:28",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~3",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 4,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "From: DoNotReplyCustomerServices \nSent: 04 September 2025 10:26\nTo: \u0027sanitized\u002Be2daa052@example.com\u0027 \u003Csanitized\u002Be2daa052@example.com\u003E\nSubject: Virgin Atlantic Holidays\n\nHello Mr Morgan,\n\nIt was lovely speaking with you this morning.\n\nI am just sending you an email to advise that your holiday is still currently down as Maya. \n\nWhen you are ready to make your amendment please do give us a call back and we will update your booking so that it shows your correct name. The reason I have not updated this now for you is because we charge a \u00A350 admin fee for name corrections, instead of you having to pay \u00A350 more we can do the amendment at time of making you date change to your booking.\n\nKind regards\nRhianna\nService Advisor\nVirgin Atlantic Holidays\n",
          "displayName": "Rhianna Foley",
          "dateModified": "2025-09-04T10:26:45",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~4",
          "noteId": 0
        }
      ],
      "advNotes": [
        {
          "no": 1,
          "code": "Travel Insurance - comprehensive - all bookings",
          "description": "Travel Insurance - comprehensive - all bookings",
          "note": "We strongly recommend customers purchase Travel Insurance IMMEDIATELY to \nensure they are adequately covered should they need to cancel or postpone their\nholiday.  Travel insurance can be purchased with us via our website, please visit \nhttps://www.virginholidays.co.uk/travel-extras/travel-insurance",
