          "code": "Virgin Atlantic- Sporting Goods",
          "description": "Virgin Atlantic- Sporting Goods",
          "note": "Baggage fees for sporting goods may apply on Virgin Atlantic Services, so please \nread their Baggage policy, which can be found on their website \n(www.virginatlantic.com).",
