        {
          "no": 4,
          "code": "Zika - Jamaica - 2018 onwards",
          "description": "Zika - Jamaica - 2018 onwards",
          "note": "UK Government AdviseUK and NaTHNaC regularly review the transmission of Zika \nvirus (ZIKV) in many countries around the world, and update guidance for \ntravellers if appropriate. Following recent reports of Zika cases in your chosen \nholiday destination, pregnant women or those who are planning on becoming \npregnant, are advised to avoid travelling to until after pregnancy. Please check \nthe travelhealthpro.org.uk and/ or \nhttps://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice websites before making your booking.",
          "dateModified": "2023-02-15T09:32:14",
          "external": true,
          "internal": true,
