          "code": "Virgin Atlantic Holidays Password/s:",
          "description": "Virgin Atlantic Holidays Password/s:",
          "note": "By adding a password to the booking, this allows all password holders full access\nto the holiday reservation {in its full entirety}, this includes the ability to update\nthe contact details, make changes and even cancel the holiday in full.\n- Unless noted otherwise",
